OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity staff walk out over
OL,4,Acuts to 400 jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 50 people joined a picket line at
OL,7,Fthe University of Essex in protest
OL,8,Fagainst cuts to 400 full-time jobs.
OL,10,FThe union, Unison, said admissions
OL,11,Fadvisors, IT technicians, admin workers
OL,12,Fand other staff walked out of the
OL,13,FColchester campus for the one-day
OL,14,Fstrike on Monday.
OL,16,FIn December, the university announced
OL,17,Fit would be axing the jobs over the
OL,18,Ffollowing two years.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
